      "claim": "Patupilone, an epothilone analog sharing the same thiazole side chain and macrocyclic lactone core as the query, demonstrated CNS penetration in rats and mice with brain concentrations significantly greater than other tissues, directly supporting meaningful BBB access for the closely related query epothilone D.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
